      "role": "user",
      "content": "the senator part is good, but i think the activist sounds a bit too much like a caricature. can you make the activist's arguments a bit more rambling and less focused? also, it would be better if the senator's dialogue was more authoritative and intellectually superior, like he's actually winning the debate through sheer logic. make it so the reader can clearly see he's the one with the actual plan and the activist is just reacting emotionally.",
